 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "# Descriptive Statistics with Dataframes\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates the dataframes package for tabular data analysis\n",
    "in Maxima — column aggregations, `df_describe`, filtering, grouping,\n",
    "summarizing, and joins."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "load(\"dataframes\")$"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o213",
    "executionCount": 21
   },
   "execution_count": 21,
   "outputs": []
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 1. Building a Dataset\n",
    "\n",
    "Create a mixed-type table representing sales data: a categorical column\n",
    "for region, a string column for product, and numeric columns for price\n",
    "and quantity."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "regions : df_string_column([\"North\", \"South\", \"North\", \"East\",\n",
    "                            \"South\", \"East\", \"North\", \"South\",\n",
    "                            \"East\", \"North\", \"South\", \"East\"])$\n",
    "products : df_string_column([\"Widget\", \"Widget\", \"Gadget\", \"Widget\",\n",
    "                             \"Gadget\", \"Gadget\", \"Widget\", \"Widget\",\n",
    "                             \"Widget\", \"Gadget\", \"Gadget\", \"Widget\"])$\n",
    "prices : ndarray([12.50, 15.00, 22.00, 14.00,\n",
    "                  21.50, 23.00, 13.00, 16.00,\n",
    "                  14.50, 24.00, 20.00, 13.50])$\n",
    "qty : ndarray([100.0, 80.0, 45.0, 90.0,\n",
    "               50.0, 40.0, 110.0, 75.0,\n",
    "               85.0, 35.0, 55.0, 95.0])$\n",
    "\n",
    "sales : df_table([\"region\", \"product\", \"price\", \"qty\"],\n",
    "                 [regions, products, prices, qty])$\n",
    "sales;"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o222",
    "executionCount": 22
   },
   "execution_count": 22,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 12.50     & 100.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Widget} & 15.00     & 80.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 22.00     & 45.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 14.00     & 90.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 21.50     & 50.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Gadget} & 23.00     & 40.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 13.00     & 110.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Widget} & 16.00     & 75.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 14.50     & 85.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.00     & 35.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 20.00     & 55.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 13.50     & 95.00     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{12 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{llll} \\textbf{region} & \\textbf{product} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 12.50     & 100.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Widget} & 15.00     & 80.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 22.00     & 45.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 14.00     & 90.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 21.50     & 50.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Gadget} & 23.00     & 40.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Widget} & 13.00     & 110.0     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Widget} & 16.00     & 75.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 14.50     & 85.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{North} & \\text{Gadget} & 24.00     & 35.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{South} & \\text{Gadget} & 20.00     & 55.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{East} & \\text{Widget} & 13.50     & 95.00     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{12 rows} \\times \\text{4 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 2. Basic Inspection"
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "df_table_shape(sales);"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o226",
