  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "## 4. df_describe — Summary Statistics Table\n",
    "\n",
    "Produces a table of summary statistics (count, mean, std, min, 25%, 50%,\n",
    "75%, max) for each numeric column. String columns are skipped."
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "df_describe(sales);"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "outputLabel": "%o270",
    "executionCount": 31
   },
   "execution_count": 31,
   "outputs": [
    {
     "output_type": "execute_result",
     "data": {
      "text/latex": [
       "\\begin{array}{lll} \\textbf{stat} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{count} & 12.00     & 12.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{mean} & 17.42     & 71.67     \\\\\\\\ \\text{std} & 4.327     & 25.61     \\\\\\\\ \\text{min} & 12.50     & 35.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{25\\%} & 13.88     & 48.75     \\\\\\\\ \\text{50\\%} & 15.50     & 77.50     \\\\\\\\ \\text{75\\%} & 21.63     & 91.25     \\\\\\\\ \\text{max} & 24.00     & 110.0     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{8 rows} \\times \\text{3 cols} \\end{array}"
      ],
      "text/plain": [
       "\\begin{array}{lll} \\textbf{stat} & \\textbf{price} & \\textbf{qty} \\\\\\\\ \\textit{str} & \\textit{f64} & \\textit{f64} \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{count} & 12.00     & 12.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{mean} & 17.42     & 71.67     \\\\\\\\ \\text{std} & 4.327     & 25.61     \\\\\\\\ \\text{min} & 12.50     & 35.00     \\\\\\\\ \\text{25\\%} & 13.88     & 48.75     \\\\\\\\ \\text{50\\%} & 15.50     & 77.50     \\\\\\\\ \\text{75\\%} & 21.63     & 91.25     \\\\\\\\ \\text{max} & 24.00     & 110.0     \\\\\\\\ \\hline \\text{8 rows} \\times \\text{3 cols} \\end{array}"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "execution_count": null
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "source": [
    "The result is a regular `df_table` — you can extract specific stats:"
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
